        &lt;text&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Purpose&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style="font-size: 11px;" align="left"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;This document includes instructions to remove the Airwatch MDM agent from both Android and iOS devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1 style="margin: 12pt 0in 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt;How to Remove AirWatch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 1em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11pt;"&gt;These instructions are offered as general instructions for all devices. Your device’s actual steps may vary. If you have questions or need assistance with your mobile phone, please contact IT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 1em 0px;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Access to email remotely will no longer require AirWatch be installed on your device.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style="margin: 2pt 0in 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt;How to uninstall the AirWatch software from an Android Device&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol style="list-style-position: inside;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Security &amp;gt; Device administrators.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Agent to uncheck the item.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Deactivate and then touch OK.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Go to the Home screen.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Uninstall.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Application Manager &amp;gt; Agent, and then touch Uninstall twice.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 style="margin: 2pt 0in 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt;How to uninstall the AirWatch software from an iOS Device&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol style="list-style-position: inside;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch Settings&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Touch General&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Scroll the Bottom&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Select the Option “Device Management” or “Profiles”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Select “AirWatch MDM/V_?”&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Tap the Red “Remove Management” button&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Enter your normal phone Passcode&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Tap the Red “Remove” button&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Return to the main phone screen&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Tap and hold the AirWatch Agent Application&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Wait until it shakes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;Tap the small ‘x’ in the upper right hand corner&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;]]&gt;&lt;/text&gt;
